WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:03.020
JENNY BROWN: Today we're
talking about security

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.580
and sustainability.

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:07.640
I'm Jenny Brown and welcome
to This Week in Cloud,

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.970
where we serve you the
lowest latency news.

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:14.300
Google Cloud has launched a
security solution, Web App

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.600
and API Protection, where
we're combining three products

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.390
to provide comprehensive
threat protection for your web

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:22.760
applications and APIs--

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:26.990
Google Cloud Armor, Apigee,
and reCAPTCHA Enterprise.

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:30.740
We've got an on-demand webinar,
a white paper, and a solution

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:33.640
page to help you
get started today.

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:36.280
Some of the most important
data at your company

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.280
isn't living in databases
but in documents.

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:42.310
And most business
processes begin, involve,

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:44.230
or end with a document.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:47.350
Many organizations are
still manually entering data

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:50.200
and leaving heaps of value
on the table in terms

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.510
of better customer experiences.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:56.980
The latest release of Document
AI platform, Lending DocAI,

00:00:56.980 --> 00:01:01.390
and Procurement DocAI, built
on decades of AI innovation

00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:04.510
at Google, bring powerful
and useful solutions

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:06.130
to these challenges.

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:08.110
Check out the blog to
learn more about what's

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:10.240
going on under the hood.

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:13.540
From efficient data centers
to purchasing renewable energy

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:16.660
at scale, Google is
dedicated to doing our part

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:19.180
to protect the
environment and planet.

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:23.050
Chrome OS provides sustainable
computing software and hardware

00:01:23.050 --> 00:01:25.840
through our ecosystem of
partners and customers,

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:28.780
from energy efficiency
to responsible supply

00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:30.310
chain and operations.

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:32.710
Check out the link for more.

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:35.560
We've launched an updated
version of our Google Cloud

00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:38.770
Security Foundations Guide
and corresponding Terraform

00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:40.120
Blueprint scripts.

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:43.720
In these resources we provide
opinionated step-by-step

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:46.540
guidance for creating
a secured landing zone

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:49.870
into which you can configure
and deploy your Google Cloud

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:51.010
workloads.

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:53.960
From key decision points
to areas of focus,

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:56.950
we provide the why behind
our recommendations,

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:59.650
but of course, you're
free to do your own thing.

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:02.840
Check them out in our
Best Practices Center.

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:05.180
If you want to read more
about these announcements

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:07.920
or see a full list,
check out the link.

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:09.470
Any thoughts or ideas?

00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:11.310
Leave us a comment or tweet us.

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:13.480
We'll see you in the Cloud.

